---
import BaseLayout from '@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Header from '@/components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '@/components/Footer.astro';
import FinalCTA from '@/components/FinalCTA.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Pioneering Creator Commerce: Twitch Sells Out"
  description="Four years before TikTok Shop launched in the US, we created live creator commerce with a 36-hour QVC-style livestream that drove $24M in incremental Amazon Prime Day revenue."
>
  <Header slot="header" />

  <!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════
     SECTION 1: HERO
     ═══════════════════════════════════════════ -->
<section class="cs-hero section">
  <div class="cs-hero-inner">
    <div>
      <span class="eyebrow">— Case Study</span>
      <h1>Pioneering Creator Commerce: Twitch Sells Out</h1>
      <p class="cs-hero-desc">
        In 2019 — four years before TikTok Shop launched in the United States — I conceived and led the go-to-market strategy for Twitch Sells Out, a first-of-its-kind, 36-hour QVC-style livestream that turned Amazon Prime Day into an interactive creator-led shopping experience. The program drove $24M in incremental revenue and 89K Prime trial sign-ups, establishing the live creator commerce category that the industry is just now catching up to.
      </p>
      <div class="cs-hero-meta">
        <div class="cs-hero-meta-item">
          <span class="cs-hero-meta-label">Company</span>
          <span class="cs-hero-meta-value">Amazon / Twitch</span>
        </div>
        <div class="cs-hero-meta-item">
          <span class="cs-hero-meta-label">Industry</span>
          <span class="cs-hero-meta-value">Live Streaming / E-Commerce</span>
        </div>
        <div class="cs-hero-meta-item">
          <span class="cs-hero-meta-label">Scope</span>
          <span class="cs-hero-meta-value">Global (US, Canada, UK, EU)</span>
        </div>
        <div class="cs-hero-meta-item">
          <span class="cs-hero-meta-label">Focus</span>
          <span class="cs-hero-meta-value">Go-to-Market &amp; Creator Commerce</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="cs-hero-image">
      <img src="https://butcherbird.com/wp-content/uploads/Screen-Shot-2023-06-13-at-4.21.55-PM-1024x590.png" alt="Twitch Sells Out live commerce broadcast" />
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════
     SECTION 2: RESULTS STRIP
     ═══════════════════════════════════════════ -->
<section class="cs-results-strip section">
  <div class="cs-results-strip-inner">
    <div class="cs-result-stat">
      <div class="cs-stat-num">$24M</div>
      <div class="cs-stat-label">Incremental Prime Day Revenue</div>
    </div>
    <div class="cs-result-stat">
      <div class="cs-stat-num">89K</div>
      <div class="cs-stat-label">Prime Trial Sign-Ups</div>
    </div>
    <div class="cs-result-stat">
      <div class="cs-stat-num">115M+</div>
      <div class="cs-stat-label">Campaign Impressions</div>
    </div>
    <div class="cs-result-stat">
      <div class="cs-stat-num">2019</div>
      <div class="cs-stat-label">Four Years Before TikTok Shop</div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════
     SECTION 3: THE SITUATION
     ═══════════════════════════════════════════ -->
<section class="cs-section section">
  <span class="eyebrow">— The Situation</span>
  <h2>Creating a Category That Didn't Exist Yet</h2>
  <p>
    It's 2019. TikTok Shop won't launch in the U.S. for another four years. The phrase "live commerce" barely exists in western markets. But Twitch — Amazon's live streaming platform with 35 million active U.S. viewers — is sitting on a massive, untapped opportunity: a highly engaged audience of gamers and tech enthusiasts, many of whom aren't yet Prime members, watching a platform purpose-built for live interaction. Amazon Prime Day is coming, and nobody has figured out how to make live creator-driven shopping work at scale.
  </p>
  <div class="cs-challenge-grid">
    <ul class="cs-challenge-list">
      <li class="cs-challenge-item">
        <div class="cs-challenge-num">1</div>
        <div class="cs-challenge-text">
          <strong>No precedent for live commerce on any western platform.</strong> Creator-led live shopping didn't exist in the U.S. There was no playbook for integrating product sales into live entertainment without alienating the audience.
        </div>
      </li>
      <li class="cs-challenge-item">
        <div class="cs-challenge-num">2</div>
        <div class="cs-challenge-text">
          <strong>30 million non-Prime viewers to convert.</strong> Of Twitch's 35M active U.S. viewers, only 5M were Prime members — creating a huge conversion opportunity that required the right incentive and experience.
        </div>
      </li>
      <li class="cs-challenge-item">
        <div class="cs-challenge-num">3</div>
        <div class="cs-challenge-text">
          <strong>A 36-hour live production with 29 creators.</strong> Coordinating a marathon broadcast with dozens of talent, over 100 products, and complex commerce integrations required flawless production and marketing orchestration.
        </div>
      </li>
      <li class="cs-challenge-item">
        <div class="cs-challenge-num">4</div>
        <div class="cs-challenge-text">
          <strong>Authenticity at scale.</strong> Twitch's audience is famously skeptical of overt sales tactics. The format needed to feel genuinely entertaining — where commerce enhanced the experience rather than interrupted it.
        </div>
      </li>
    </ul>
    <div class="cs-callout">
      <span class="eyebrow" style="color:var(--green-lt)">— The Mandate</span>
      <blockquote>
        Invent a live commerce format that drives Prime Day sales and Prime sign-ups while staying true to Twitch's irreverent, community-first culture — years before anyone else would attempt it.
      </blockquote>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════
     SECTION 4: THE APPROACH
     ═══════════════════════════════════════════ -->
<div class="cs-approach section">
  <div class="cs-section-inner">
    <span class="eyebrow">— The Approach</span>
    <h2>QVC Meets Twitch: Commerce as Entertainment</h2>
    <p>
      The strategy was to reimagine the classic TV shopping format through the lens of Twitch culture — irreverent, interactive, and creator-driven. Instead of a slick infomercial, we built a 36-hour live experience where top streamers authentically showcased products they genuinely use, wrapped in the over-the-top, satirical energy that Twitch's audience loves.
    </p>
    <div class="cs-phases">
      <div class="cs-phase-card">
        <div class="cs-phase-num">01</div>
        <div class="cs-phase-title">Concept &amp; Format Design</div>
        <div class="cs-phase-desc">
          Developed the "TVC" concept — Twitch's irreverent spin on QVC. Designed 18 two-hour segments, each featuring paired creators matched with products they authentically use, plus interstitial entertainment content to keep the energy high across the full 36-hour marathon.
        </div>
        <div class="cs-phase-tools">
          <a href="/services/go-to-market" class="cs-phase-tool">Go-to-Market Strategy →</a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="cs-phase-card">
        <div class="cs-phase-num">02</div>
        <div class="cs-phase-title">Multi-Channel Pre-Launch Campaign</div>
        <div class="cs-phase-desc">
          Executed a 10-day pre-launch flight across paid social, email, house media, PR, and creator socials — building hype with custom video content produced at studio with featured creators. The campaign drove awareness and Prime trial sign-ups before the show even started.
        </div>
        <div class="cs-phase-tools">
          <a href="/services/integrated-marketing" class="cs-phase-tool">Integrated Marketing →</a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="cs-phase-card">
        <div class="cs-phase-num">03</div>
        <div class="cs-phase-title">Creator-Led Commerce Integration</div>
        <div class="cs-phase-desc">
          Curated 29 creators and paired them with 100+ products across gaming, electronics, and lifestyle categories. Integrated Amazon directly for in-stream purchasing, enabling viewers to buy without leaving Twitch.
        </div>
        <div class="cs-phase-tools">
          <a href="/services/content-creator-marketing" class="cs-phase-tool">Content &amp; Creator Marketing →</a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="cs-phase-card">
        <div class="cs-phase-num">04</div>
        <div class="cs-phase-title">Real-Time Commerce Optimization</div>
        <div class="cs-phase-desc">
          Built manufacturer co-marketing partnerships with gaming hardware and electronics brands. Sourced 7 of the top 10 products sold directly from manufacturers — products that weren't originally Prime Day deals — creating exclusive value for the Twitch audience.
        </div>
        <div class="cs-phase-tools">
          <a href="/services/growth-marketing" class="cs-phase-tool">Growth &amp; Lifecycle Marketing →</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- Visual gallery section — add when imagery is available -->

<!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════
     SECTION 6: BEFORE / AFTER
     ═══════════════════════════════════════════ -->
<section class="cs-ba section">
  <div class="cs-ba-inner">
    <span class="eyebrow">— Transformation</span>
    <h2>Before &amp; After Twitch Sells Out</h2>
    <div class="cs-ba-grid">
      <div class="cs-ba-before">
        <div class="cs-ba-label">Before</div>
        <div class="cs-ba-item">
          <div class="cs-ba-bullet"></div>
          <div class="cs-ba-text">No live creator commerce existed on any western platform</div>
        </div>
        <div class="cs-ba-item">
          <div class="cs-ba-bullet"></div>
          <div class="cs-ba-text">Twitch had never participated directly in Prime Day commerce</div>
        </div>
        <div class="cs-ba-item">
          <div class="cs-ba-bullet"></div>
          <div class="cs-ba-text">30 million active viewers who weren't Prime members</div>
        </div>
        <div class="cs-ba-item">
          <div class="cs-ba-bullet"></div>
          <div class="cs-ba-text">No proven model for creator-driven product sales at scale</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="cs-ba-after">
        <div class="cs-ba-label">After</div>
        <div class="cs-ba-item">
          <div class="cs-ba-bullet"></div>
          <div class="cs-ba-text">$24M in incremental Prime Day revenue driven through the program</div>
        </div>
        <div class="cs-ba-item">
          <div class="cs-ba-bullet"></div>
          <div class="cs-ba-text">Created the live creator commerce category — four years before TikTok Shop</div>
        </div>
        <div class="cs-ba-item">
          <div class="cs-ba-bullet"></div>
          <div class="cs-ba-text">89,006 Prime trial sign-ups — a 19% lift</div>
        </div>
        <div class="cs-ba-item">
          <div class="cs-ba-bullet"></div>
          <div class="cs-ba-text">Participating creators saw viewership grow by double-digit percentages post-show</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════
     SECTION 7: RESULTS DEEP DIVE
     ═══════════════════════════════════════════ -->
<section class="cs-results section">
  <div class="cs-results-inner">
    <span class="eyebrow">— Results</span>
    <h2>
      The Numbers Tell the Story
    </h2>
    <p>
      Twitch Sells Out proved that creator-led live commerce could drive massive commercial impact — years before the rest of the industry would catch on.
    </p>
    <div class="cs-results-grid">
      <div class="cs-result-card">
        <div class="cs-result-metric">$24M</div>
        <div class="cs-result-label">Incremental Revenue</div>
        <div class="cs-result-desc">
          The program drove $24M in incremental Amazon Prime Day purchases. Viewers discovered products through the show and expanded their shopping across all of Prime Day, creating a halo effect far beyond the 100+ featured items.
        </div>
        <div class="cs-result-bar"><div class="cs-result-bar-fill" style="width:100%"></div></div>
      </div>
      <div class="cs-result-card">
        <div class="cs-result-metric">89K</div>
        <div class="cs-result-label">Prime Trial Sign-Ups</div>
        <div class="cs-result-desc">
          Drove 89,006 new Prime sign-ups worldwide — a 19% lift. Over 93% of sign-ups came from Europe and North America, with email driving the highest conversion rates.
        </div>
        <div class="cs-result-bar"><div class="cs-result-bar-fill" style="width:90%"></div></div>
      </div>
      <div class="cs-result-card">
        <div class="cs-result-metric">115M+</div>
        <div class="cs-result-label">Campaign Impressions</div>
        <div class="cs-result-desc">
          The largest-scale marketing reach Twitch achieved in 2019. The multi-channel pre-launch campaign — spanning email, house ads with a record 89.45% VCR, paid social across FB/IG/Snap, and PR — drove massive awareness.
        </div>
        <div class="cs-result-bar"><div class="cs-result-bar-fill" style="width:85%"></div></div>
      </div>
      <div class="cs-result-card">
        <div class="cs-result-metric">+32%</div>
        <div class="cs-result-label">Creator Viewership Growth</div>
        <div class="cs-result-desc">
          Participating creators saw minutes watched grow 32%, total viewers increase 18%, and active viewers jump 20% in the week following the show — proving the program was a positive force for creator growth.
        </div>
        <div class="cs-result-bar"><div class="cs-result-bar-fill" style="width:80%"></div></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════
     SECTION 8: IMPACT
     ═══════════════════════════════════════════ -->
<section class="cs-impact section">
  <div class="cs-impact-inner">
  <span class="eyebrow">— Impact</span>
  <h2>We Created the Category Everyone's Talking About Now</h2>
  <p>
    In 2023, TikTok Shop launched in the United States and "live commerce" became the industry's hottest buzzword. Brands scrambled to figure out creator-led shopping. Consultants declared it the future of e-commerce. But we built and scaled this format in 2019 — four years earlier — on a platform with 35 million active viewers. Twitch Sells Out wasn't an experiment. It was the proof of concept that the entire category was built on.
  </p>
  <p>
    The program also proved immense value to manufacturer partners, with 7 of the top 10 products sold coming from directly sourced partnerships. This validated a model where brands pay for inclusion — transforming the format from a cost center into a revenue-generating platform. The pre-event marketing campaign set new benchmarks across every channel, including the first House Ad campaign in Twitch history to beat VCR benchmarks at 89.45%.
  </p>
  <div class="cs-impact-callout">
    <div class="cs-impact-icon">🛒</div>
    <div class="cs-impact-text">
      Four years before TikTok Shop launched in the U.S., we turned a live streaming platform into a $24M commerce engine — driving 89K Prime sign-ups and establishing the live creator commerce category that the industry is just now catching up to.
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════
     SECTION 9: SERVICES USED
     ═══════════════════════════════════════════ -->
<section class="cs-services section">
  <div class="cs-services-inner">
  <span class="eyebrow">— Capabilities Applied</span>
  <h2>
    What This Took
  </h2>
  <div class="cs-services-pills">
    <a href="/services/go-to-market" class="cs-service-pill">Go-to-Market Strategy</a>
    <a href="/services/integrated-marketing" class="cs-service-pill">Integrated Marketing</a>
    <a href="/services/content-creator-marketing" class="cs-service-pill">Content &amp; Creator Marketing</a>
    <a href="/services/growth-marketing" class="cs-service-pill">Growth &amp; Lifecycle Marketing</a>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════
     SECTION 10: CTA
     ═══════════════════════════════════════════ -->
<FinalCTA />


  <Footer slot="footer" />
</BaseLayout>
